{"title":"2020 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Verifying_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Verifying Solution</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A square is cut into two identical rectangles, as shown.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Each of these two rectangles has perimeter 24 cm. What is the area of the original square?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the numbers are consecutive integers, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/d/5ed6b1998a765c224e1ed4ebd2da3806f5f4ccc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = a + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/b/9abdac83cf561235f391e98904ad1b0cdde47d97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = a + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/9/129ab77611be6439b9a2b759bc0684d19cc7df01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = a + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/b/58b0d71d210265d3a3677dde5ae02448c19ec725.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$e = a + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" />. This means:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/9/5f9ea29057a2fecb03955b1bbb28def4290eb758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{2} + (a + 1)^{2} + (a + 2)^{2} = (a + 3)^{2} + (a + 4)^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"360\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/4/1448bcc08c91366dfee1359a0452df52f1ddab6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{2} + a^{2} + 2 \\times 1 \\times a + 1^{1} + a^{2} + 2 \\times 2 \\times a + 2^{2} = a^{2} + 2 \\times 3 \\times a + 3^{2} + a^{2} + 2 \\times 4 \\times a + 4^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"711\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/d/a0d6fe6ae559721f83e9201da3067723035455e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a^{2} + 2a + 1 + 4a + 4 = 2a^{2} + 6a + 9 + 8a + 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"376\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/e/05e6f37c6883fc863d8690fcb6d0dbf6125e9ff1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a^{2} + 6a + a^{2} + 5 = 2a^{2} + 6a + 8a + 9 + 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"343\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/c/84cf4b85fe2d72577430372c916ed793f98e4768.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{2} = 8a + 25 - 5 = 8a + 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"217\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/a/7fabdccc619503ba3d68cbc822e8e6cafce72d29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{2} - 8a - 20 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"134\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/9/839ea9e47f0303341c4d306172612a4de540799e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{2} - 10a + 2a - 20 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"184\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/4/68446a1a4f747cdc3d9452958d6be953fb4dbf12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(a - 10) + 2(a - 10) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"204\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/4/ab4fa015f7fe42e097e7b6872f901fbbd1928050.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a + 2)(a - 10) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"154\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>This means that either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d6cc5bbcaca2ea70d1998da025c3f0873bb8562.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"13\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/4/844261808b8af79e74512c968631470ddc288a58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = -2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"15\" />. However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is a positive number, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/c/73c275b1b2999aa7219c9bd239b18a20183753f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{a = 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"65\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the numbers are consecutive integers, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/1/e11daa934c7cbe45e301af7eb3646fcab55ff1f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = c - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/d/41df5058806889546c660fab976d7d4dc3a99d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = c - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"73\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/4/4948901c4b4d2d57c1fb3f61921b7b7cd7be26b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = c + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/9/759b8f9df76b21273a133c8f3f73201507469a60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$e = c + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" />. This means:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/7/2370d1c1387b338e149583ff2116a128737c81db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(c - 2)^{2} + (c - 1)^{2} + c^{2} = (c + 1)^{2} + (c + 2)^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"351\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/c/bdc1a4f59ba215affaf19ffbda11968793d88654.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c^{2} - 2 \\times 2 \\times c + 2^{2} + c^{2} - 2 \\times 1 \\times c + 1^{2} = c^{2} + 2 \\times 1 \\times c + 1^{2} + c^{2} + 2 \\times 2 + 2^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"628\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/3/153915729a8f213d29c5bdcdb0ac19517c3d4079.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c^{2} - 4c - 2c = 4c + 2c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"176\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/9/2d9b0fd58db602c9ba2cd51a1f00a94ffb0ba736.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c^{2} - 12c = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/a/45adf927bc51034eab6a2334172fd2fdbeb441b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c(c - 12) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"105\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>From this, either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/4/db496a2fade0867e2dedc83ca9cf6262560559a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/e/2eeb57269daee143ec45dcedeadf422f2cf9b271.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" />. However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> is a positive number, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/e/2eeb57269daee143ec45dcedeadf422f2cf9b271.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" />. This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/e/1bef62254efe5ed3c3beaf0783e0c125e97448bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = c - 2 = 12 - 2 = \\boxed{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"202\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Verifying_Solution\">Verifying Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Verifying Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d6cc5bbcaca2ea70d1998da025c3f0873bb8562.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/8/d78ed94215e8e444e06174a1f8666665be7b720d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/e/2eeb57269daee143ec45dcedeadf422f2cf9b271.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/a/f7ad008adc3b75e9caad614562a143c08f996c49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"54\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/e/05eacf709ec2d4834d7cfeca718c8e778a1387f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$e = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" /> because the numbers are consecutive integers. For the left hand side, this gives:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/e/fae38a5f2fcdee3dff33d9b26584b84f2ff3e440.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{2} + 11^{2} + 12^{2} = 100 + 121 + 144$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"274\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/c/30cefd868dedbd2bc18212b8585def3fdc14d014.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=221 + 144$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"98\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/6/2063f10423c2ec10900ab47aa7f58fa08681160c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=365$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>For the right hand side, this gives:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/c/bac987cb385c5f911b0f0d3e2d3ab9494ac7b63c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13^{2} + 14^{2} = 169 + 196 = 365$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"228\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>These numbers both match, so we can verify that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d6cc5bbcaca2ea70d1998da025c3f0873bb8562.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"13\" /> works out.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC\" title=\"2020 CSMC\">2020 CSMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CSMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CSMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2020 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2020 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2020 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2020 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2020 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Senior_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Senior Competition\">CEMC Senior Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018063015\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 259/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1693/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 134/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7945/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   19.720      1 -total\n 36.07%    7.114      1 Template:CEMC_CIMC/CSMC_box\n 27.55%    5.4